BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:e8c4086f99fa3b2b874c3d4ee53ceaf03d928dcf@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261107T091553Z
DTSTART:20261107T140000Z
DTEND:20261107T160000Z
SUMMARY:You Can See Everything
LOCATION:Beacon Cinema\, 57 North St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Times: 9am\, 12:20pm\, 4pm\, 7:30pm\nThirty-four days before sh
 e’s sent to prison\, notorious Silicon Valley founder Elizabeth Holmes i
 nvites a skeptical film crew to document her every move. What begins as an
  intimate portrait of an enigmatic felon becomes a mind-bending three-year
  journey into the abyss. From boundary-pushing directors Nathan Fielder an
 d Lance Oppenheim comes You Can See Everything.\nhttps://www.phoenixmovies
 .net/movies/you-can-see-everything/HO00001794\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: 
 https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/you-can-see-everything/HO00001794
END:VEVENT
