BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:0f12439b868eff75f31706935397365a1d19d92b@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261107T091553Z
DTSTART:20261107T144500Z
DTEND:20261107T164500Z
SUMMARY:Wildwood
LOCATION:Beacon Cinema\, 57 North St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Times: 9:45am\, 12:30pm\, 3:20pm\, 6pm\nWildwood is a handcraft
 ed epic fantasy that transports audiences into a secret\, dangerously aliv
 e world. A girl’s desperate quest to save her baby brother unfolds into 
 a spectacular\, high-stakes adventure through a forbidden forest full of e
 nchanted creatures\, endearing allies\, and formidable adversaries—where
  an entire hidden realm hangs in the balance. In an era of automation\, LA
 IKA delivers its most ambitious and globally accessible film yet—a bold 
 fusion of human-crafted artistry and cinematic storytelling from the maker
 s of Coraline.\nhttps://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/wildwood/HO00001782\n
 From Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/wildwood/HO00001782
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:1cee0afec6b9f37d1bac5b59936712b41567072e@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261107T091553Z
DTSTART:20261107T151000Z
DTEND:20261107T171000Z
SUMMARY:Wild Horse Nine
LOCATION:Beacon Cinema\, 57 North St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Times: 10:10am\, 12:40pm\, 3:10pm\, 5:40pm\, 8:10pm\, 10:40pm\n
 Shortly before the 1973 Chilean coup\, CIA agents Chris (John Malkovich) a
 nd Lee (Sam Rockwell) are dispatched from Santiago to Easter island by the
 ir bureau chief\, MJ (Steve Buscemi). Amongst the Island's iconic statues\
 , and as the longtime partners wrestle with their dark pasts and present c
 onspiracies\, Chris's newfound bond with a pair of rebellious students (Ma
 riana di Girolamo and Ailín Salas) threatens to send everyone’s trip to
  this remote paradise sideways.\nhttps://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/wild
 -horse-nine/HO00001795\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/we
 sternma/
URL:https://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/wild-horse-nine/HO00001795
END:VEVENT
