SUMMARY:Godzilla Minus Zero
LOCATION:Beacon Cinema\, 57 North St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Times: 10:30am\, 1:20pm\, 4:10pm\, 7pm\, 8:50pm\, 9:50pm\, 10:5
 5pm\nWar reduced Japan to zero\, and Godzilla plunged it into minus. Two y
 ears have passed since then\, and the country has faced agonizing struggle
 s to achieve recovery and finally reclaim its daily life.\nhttps://www.pho
 enixmovies.net/movies/godzilla-minus-zero/HO00001786\nFrom Pushpin Western
  Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/godzilla-minus-zero/HO00001786
END:VEVENT
