 ing Hollywood star to revenge-filled monster in a story that explores the 
 loss of one’s identity and humanity\, corrosive love\, and the dark unde
 rbelly of scientific ambition.\nhttps://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/clayf
 ace/HO00001765\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
