SUMMARY:Wildwood
LOCATION:Beacon Cinema\, 57 North St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Times: 9:45am\, 12:30pm\, 3:20pm\, 6pm\nWildwood is a handcraft
 ed epic fantasy that transports audiences into a secret\, dangerously aliv
 e world. A girl’s desperate quest to save her baby brother unfolds into 
 a spectacular\, high-stakes adventure through a forbidden forest full of e
 nchanted creatures\, endearing allies\, and formidable adversaries—where
  an entire hidden realm hangs in the balance. In an era of automation\, LA
 IKA delivers its most ambitious and globally accessible film yet—a bold 
 fusion of human-crafted artistry and cinematic storytelling from the maker
 s of Coraline.\nhttps://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/wildwood/HO00001782\n
 From Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/wildwood/HO00001782
END:VEVENT
